<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018) & Inaba et al. (2019) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling and melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion in galliform plumage stripes (Galliform chicks — Japanese quail (Coturnix japonica), common pheasant (Phasianus colchicus), guineafowl (Numida meleagris), partridge (Alectoris rufa), and turkey (Meleagris gallopavo))",
        "Haupaix et al. (2018) & Inaba et al. (2019) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling and melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion in galliform plumage stripes faithfully reproduces Galliform chicks — Japanese quail (Coturnix japonica), common pheasant (Phasianus colchicus), guineafowl (Numida meleagris), partridge (Alectoris rufa), and turkey (Meleagris gallopavo) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Galliform chicks — Japanese quail (Coturnix japonica), common pheasant (Phasianus colchicus), guineafowl (Numida meleagris), partridge (Alectoris rufa), and turkey (Meleagris gallopavo) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py> ;
    schema:about "Galliform chicks — Japanese quail (Coturnix japonica), common pheasant (Phasianus colchicus), guineafowl (Numida meleagris), partridge (Alectoris rufa), and turkey (Meleagris gallopavo)" ;
    pk:aristotelianEfficientCause "1. Chemical Turing / RD" ;
    pk:aristotelianMegistonGenos "I. Enaima (Vertebrata)" ;
    pk:aristotelianPoionForm "Stripes, Spots & Ocelli" ;
    pk:aristotelianPosonLaw "Turing Wavenumber k_c" ;
    pk:aristotelianSubalternClass "Aves (Ornithes)" ;
    pk:biologicalGenus "Coturnix" ;
